        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQxdE52LWJnEAE&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQxdE52LWJnEAE!2m1!1s0x3403e2d70a07d0c1:0x542525688724b38e"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJwdAHCtfiAzQRjrMkh2glJVQ/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxbFVrVk9VVmxPTjNKNlkzSktUbXBGVWxOa1JrRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "10 個月前",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": {
          "text": "香港天際萬豪酒店停車場的體驗可謂是喜憂參半。雖然地理位置便利，但服務卻差強人意。工作人員態度冷漠，缺乏熱情，考慮到萬豪品牌一貫的款待，這著實令人失望。值得肯定的是，停車場本身維護良好且安全可靠，這讓停車的客人感到安心。然而，缺乏基本的便利設施和對客人的幫助，實在令人遺憾。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "The Hong Kong SkyCity Marriott Hotel Car Park was a mixed experience. While the location is convenient for travelers, the service left much to be desired. The staff seemed indifferent and not particularly welcoming, which was disappointing given the Marriott brand's reputation for hospitality. On the positive side, the parking facility itself is well-maintained and secure, which is a relief for anyone leaving their vehicle behind. However, the lack of basic amenities or assistance for guests was",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Jacob",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100633402814041037060/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXcKsCyC5R5mwNC3VTX0HDnjC6lI3enttPKZMmOu4u6AASRZA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8"
        },
        "publishTime": "2025-12-23T14:37:50.370523073Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxbFVrVk9VVmxPTjNKNlkzSktUbXBGVWxOa1JrRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxbFVrVk9VVmxPTjNKNlkzSktUbXBGVWxOa1JrRRAB!2m1!1s0x3403e2d70a07d0c1:0x542525688724b38e"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJwdAHCtfiAzQRjrMkh2glJVQ/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oRWJHRkpSMHRTV1hOUU1HazJVRVl6UVV4UFVVRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 年前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "很遺憾，這家旅館簡直是萬豪連鎖的恥辱。員工普遍態度惡劣，對待菁英會員極度不尊重。當你提出任何服務要求（通常在其他萬豪酒店都是免費的）時，他們總是說沒有，但如果你額外付費就能得到。\n\n如果你投訴或升級投訴，他們的回答只有一個：“隨便你，酒店幾乎全部被航空公司機組人員預訂了，他們不在乎。”\n\n如果你升級投訴並要求與值班經理交談，你仍然會見到同一個人，因為飯店沒有任何部門（包括前台、餐飲部等）的負責人。\n\n這家旅館在香港這樣一個文明國家留下了非常糟糕的印象。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Unfortunately this hotel is a Shame on all Marriott chain , the Staff generally rude , they don’t treat the elite members properly and when you request any service ( normally free in any other Marriott ) they are answering not available but if you pay extra you will get it.\n\nIf you complain or escalate your complaint, they have one answer “ Do whatever you need the hotel is almost fully booked for the airlines crews and do not care”\n\nIf you escalate the matter and request to speak to the duty manager; you will meet the same person because there is no responsible manger for any department either front office, F&B ….etc.\n\nThis hotel is giving a very bad impression about a civilized country like Hong Kong.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "joseph mina",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107492532349117799147/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV2wF7YnSoHDLWGaHu6K-gqm84edawaY7sU7Wv3SCbNfyb0qfoo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2"
        },
        "publishTime": "2025-07-15T09:13:17.058513547Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oRWJHRkpSMHRTV1hOUU1HazJVRVl6UVV4UFVVRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oRWJHRkpSMHRTV1hOUU1HazJVRVl6UVV4UFVVRRAB!2m1!1s0x3403e2d70a07d0c1:0x542525688724b38e"
